@startuml concurrency-model
title logfence — Concurrency Model

skinparam defaultFontName Monospaced
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam BackgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam noteBorderColor #AAAAAA

rectangle "Tokio Runtime" {

  component "main task\n──────────────\nOrchestration\nSignal handler" as Main #FFEECC

  component "Semaphore\n(max_connections permits)" as Sema #FFFACC

  component "watch::channel\nSender: Arc<Validator>\n──────────────\nHolds latest validator;\nupdated on SIGHUP" as Watch #DDFFD0

  component "CancellationToken\n(shutdown)" as Cancel #FFD0D0

  component "Arc<MetricsStore>\n──────────────\nreceived  AtomicU64\nforwarded AtomicU64\ndropped   AtomicU64\nerrors    AtomicU64" as Metrics #D0F0FF

  rectangle "listener task" {
    component "UnixListener\naccept loop" as AcceptLoop #DDEEFF
  }

  rectangle "session task N" as S1 {
    component "watch::Receiver\nArc<Validator> clone\n──────────────\nPer-message borrow;\nlock released before await" as WatchRx1 #DDFFD0
    component "Codec\n(OctetCount or Delimiter)" as Codec1 #E8D0FF
  }

  rectangle "session task ..." as S2 {
    component "watch::Receiver\nArc<Validator> clone" as WatchRx2 #DDFFD0
    component "Codec" as Codec2 #E8D0FF
  }

  component "metrics socket task\n(optional feature)\n──────────────\nServes JSON snapshot\nper connecting client" as MetricsSock #D0F0FF

}

component "Arc<Forwarder>\n(shared across sessions)\n──────────────\nUnixDgram: stateless\nUnixStream: Mutex<Option<stream>>" as Forwarder #FFD0D0

Main --> Watch : SIGHUP → send(Arc<new_validator>)
Main --> Cancel : SIGTERM → cancel()
Main --> Metrics : SIGUSR1 → log snapshot()

Cancel --> AcceptLoop : cancelled() → stop accepting
Cancel --> MetricsSock : cancelled() → stop serving

AcceptLoop --> Sema : acquire permit\n(per connection)
AcceptLoop --> S1 : spawn with permit
AcceptLoop --> S2 : spawn with permit

S1 --> Sema : drop permit on EOF\nor disconnect
S2 --> Sema : drop permit on EOF\nor disconnect

WatchRx1 --> Watch : borrow() → clone Arc
WatchRx2 --> Watch : borrow() → clone Arc

Codec1 --> Forwarder : forward() on valid msg
Codec2 --> Forwarder : forward() on valid msg

Codec1 --> Metrics : inc_received()\ninc_forwarded()\ninc_dropped()\ninc_errors()
Codec2 --> Metrics : (same)

MetricsSock --> Metrics : snapshot()

note bottom of Forwarder
  UnixStream variant uses
  Mutex<Option<UnixStream>> for
  lazy-connect / auto-reconnect.
  Lock held only during write.
end note

note right of Watch
  Arc<Validator> refcount:
  - 1 in watch Sender
  - 1 per active session
    (dropped after each message)
  Old Validator freed when
  last session releases it.
end note

note right of Sema
  Backpressure: accept()
  blocks until a permit is
  available when all
  max_connections are active.
  On SIGTERM: wait up to 30 s
  for all permits to return.
end note

@enduml
